# OPTIONAL. The app ships with these values as defaults in src/lib/supabase.ts,
# so a deploy needs no configuration at all. Set them only to point the site at
# a different Supabase project; when present they override the defaults.
#
# Neither is a secret. NEXT_PUBLIC_* values are compiled into the JavaScript
# every visitor downloads. Row Level Security protects the data, not secrecy:
# this key can insert a signup and nothing else.
